title: "ABC-SHAP: code and data for an empirical diagnostic study of adaptive coalition sampling under finite budgets"
abstract: >-
  Code and experimental data reproducing the tables, figures and run-to-run
  dispersion analysis of an empirical diagnostic study of instance-specific
  adaptive coalition sampling for Kernel SHAP.
